  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "_**MAJOR VERSION - PLEASE NOTE THE FOLLOWING COMPATIBLITY CHANGES**_\n- **.NET Standard support has been dropped** (to be able to use C#9.0) - Minimum requirements are still .NET 6\n- `Track.Lyrics` is now an `IList<LyricsInfo>` instead of a `LyricsInfo` to handle files with multiple sets of lyrics\n- `LyricsInfo.TimestampMs` has been renamed to `LyricsInfo.TimestampStart`\n_New_\n- **LRC A2** and **SRT** lyrics formats are now supported\n- New `LyricsPhrase.Beats` structure that represents synchronized groups of words within the same lyrics phrase\n- New `LyricsInfo.TimestampEnd` field that represents the end timestamp of the phrase/beat\n***Binaries are available from nuGet***",
